sea_glass
Copyright 2026 THON Hermès

This package is a Flutter port of Sea Glass
(https://github.com/mttmcknn/sea-glass), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Derived from the original:
- shaders/sea_glass.frag is a translation of SeaGlassBodyShader.kt.
- lib/src/contour.dart and the geometry and ground-light code port the original
  Kotlin sources.
- tool/kotlin_reference/ builds and runs the original sources unchanged.

Changes from the original: rewritten in Dart/GLSL for Flutter; added
shadowDegrees and shadowTinted (ground light only), Material 3 palettes,
themes and button widgets.
